# Bendy and the Dark Revival (PPSA27624): Cross every 3 s for the whole window.
# Menu-probe route. It presses one button and adds no stick input, so it cannot move a list
# selection off its default entry. Anchors are SECONDS from the first pad poll (pad.cpp:207-210:
# a bare number is seconds; 'f' is flips and 'p' is pad reads).
#
# Progress oracle for this title is the Unity scene index, not pixels. Media/levelNN is the
# build-settings scene index -- 37 scene paths in Media/globalgamemanagers against 37 Media/levelNN
# files. level2 = Core/2_General/Game is the persistent game scene -- MEASURED to first open at
# t=65-70 s together with level4, NOT at the title screen, which runs on level0/level1 alone.
# level4..level36 are the Core/3_Sections/Section_S1xx_* scenes, level4 =
# Section_S101_JoeyDrewApartment, and N >= 4 is the discriminator this route is read against.
#
# This route reaches the sections and then HOLDS at the first in-world prompt, which is bound to
# SQUARE and is a hold; this route only presses Cross. That is a route limit, not a blocker --
# reach-gameplay.pad is the one that advances. Kept as the Cross-only arm that demonstrates it.
